 conf'larina eksik location bazli rate limit'i geriye donuk ekler
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- files/location_limit_backfill.sh: rate_limit var / location_limit yok -> rate satirinin
  altina ayni base ile burst=10; baslik satirlari; eksik zone'lar limit-zones.conf sonuna
  (300r/s, 10m); yorumlu (#) satirli bloklar varsayilan atlanir + raporlanir
  (include_commented ile eklenir); yedek + nginx -t + reload, duserse geri alma; idempotent
- playbook: 36 prod API gateway (GBNGWP01-16/25-32, GBNGWAP01-08/22-25), mode report|apply
- README §7, tests/check_location_limit_backfill.py (GBNGWAP01 dump: 84 dosya / 613 satir /
  32 zone, BAKARKGW 92 yorumlu blok)

